108
00:08:27,099 --> 00:08:29,679
But that's only powerful if my team knows what's happening.

109
00:08:29,679 --> 00:08:35,679
I can't expect them to capitalize on the entire enemy team looking at me unless I call it out and make them aware.

110
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:40,839
Once I do, they know that the opening exists and can immediately take advantage of it.

111
00:08:40,839 --> 00:08:47,359
And this is what it looks like in full swing when your team capitalizes on the opening Scout creates. Your value isn't always the player you kill.

112
00:08:47,539 --> 00:08:52,999
Sometimes it's how much attention you pull away from everyone else and this absolutely applies to casual as well.

113
00:08:53,299 --> 00:08:56,359
People just don't communicate it nearly enough, especially a Scout.

